-- Every tell (piece of evidence) an anomaly can leave behind.
--
-- presentation: how clients render the divergence (see PerceptionController)
--   SeamFlip        a wall seam is a doorway for some Witnesses and solid for others
--   PhantomProp     a local-only object that some Witnesses see
--   VariantProp     a real object every Witness sees, but in different states
--   PhantomSound    a sound only some Witnesses hear
--   UnobservedShift an object that moves while the viewer isn't looking
--   GhostTrail      a teammate seen a few seconds late
--   HiddenTeammate  a teammate who vanishes for one viewer near the site
--   HiddenWriting   writing that only shows up in your own flashlight beam
--   PortraitEyes    a portrait whose eyes follow one viewer
-- slot:   where the generator may place it ("seam", "wall" or "floor")
-- outside: a wall tell that only makes sense on an outer wall (a window)
-- social: only meaningful when two Witnesses compare what they perceive
-- camera: the Witness Camera can confirm it, so a lone player can check it

